            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"fta-normality-check-and-90-confidence-interval\">FTA \u2014 normality check and 90% confidence interval</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Port of <code>UnitC/CaseStudy/GSWarriro2018-2019-Season/fta-ci.jl</code>.  The Julia source\nuses <code>OneSampleADTest</code> (Anderson\u2013Darling) for normality and <code>OneSampleTTest</code> for\nthe interval; both are reproduced with scipy.</span></span>"
